# Auto detect text files and normalize line endings in the repository
* text=auto

# Binary assets
*.mp3 binary
*.mp4 binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.ttf binary
*.ttc binary
*.otf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary

# 篝火：发布包（git archive）不带英文 / 日文说明和英文界面图
README-en.md export-ignore
README-ja.md export-ignore
docs/webui-en.jpg export-ignore
